<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How many people are in the speaker’s family?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我家有五个人：爷爷、爸爸、妈妈、姐姐和我。姐姐在大学读书，我在中学上学。我们都住在一起。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五个人</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The speaker gives the family size as five.</p><p class="cn">开头直接说明家里有五个人。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我家有五个人</p><ul><li>A: Three omits two of the five family members.<br>三个人少于原文明确给出的五个人。</li><li>B: The speaker explicitly counts five, including himself.<br>说话者把自己也算在内，明确说五个人。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who stays home and cooks on Saturday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我妈妈是医生，星期六也要去医院。爸爸星期六不工作，在家做饭。我和哥哥下午一起回家吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 哥哥</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The father stays home and cooks.</p><p class="cn">爸爸星期六在家做饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 爸爸星期六不工作，在家做饭</p><ul><li>A: The mother goes to the hospital that day.<br>妈妈周六也要去医院。</li><li>C: The brother returns in the afternoon; he is not said to cook.<br>哥哥下午回家，原文没有说他做饭。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is on Grandfather’s left?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我们拍全家照时，爷爷坐在中间。爸爸站在爷爷左边，妈妈在右边。姐姐和我站在后面。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The father stands on Grandfather’s left.</p><p class="cn">爸爸在爷爷左边。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 爸爸站在爷爷左边</p><ul><li>B: The mother is on the right.<br>妈妈在爷爷右边。</li><li>C: The sister is behind him, not on the left.<br>姐姐站在后面，不是左边。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. What is the new student’s family name?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 你们好，我姓马，叫马文。我的中文老师姓林。今天王老师带我来这个班，我很高兴认识大家。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 王</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 马</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The student introduces the surname Ma.</p><p class="cn">学生说自己姓马。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我姓马，叫马文</p><ul><li>A: Lin is the Chinese teacher’s surname.<br>林是中文老师的姓。</li><li>B: Wang is the teacher who brought the student to class.<br>王是带学生来班里的老师的姓。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where do the students eat lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我们上午在教室上课，中午去学校食堂吃饭。下午下课后，大家常常去操场运动。今天我也去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>They go to the school canteen for lunch.</p><p class="cn">他们中午到学校食堂吃饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 中午去学校食堂吃饭</p><ul><li>A: They have lessons in the classroom, not lunch.<br>教室是上课的地点。</li><li>C: They use the playground for exercise after class.<br>操场是下课后运动的地点。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where should students put their bags?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 同学们，请把书包放在椅子上，不要放在地上。桌子上只放书和本子。现在我们开始上课。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地上</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The instruction places bags on chairs.</p><p class="cn">老师要求把书包放在椅子上。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请把书包放在椅子上</p><ul><li>B: Only books and notebooks belong on the desk.<br>桌子上只放书和本子。</li><li>C: The teacher explicitly says not on the floor.<br>老师明确说不要放在地上。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How many books may the student borrow at one time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 老师，我今天能借三本书吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 每人一次只能借两本。你可以先选两本，明天还书以后再借。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一本</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两本</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三本</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The teacher explicitly limits borrowing to two books.</p><p class="cn">老师说明一次只能借两本。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每人一次只能借两本</p><ul><li>A: One is not the stated limit.<br>规则没有把上限设为一本。</li><li>C: Three is requested but not allowed.<br>三本是学生的请求，不符合规则。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Where will today’s PE lesson take place?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天体育课还在教室吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 不，今天不下雨，我们去操场上课。</p><p class="cn">female · 好的，我叫同学们一起去操场。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Both speakers confirm the playground.</p><p class="cn">双方都确认去操场。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们去操场上课</p><ul><li>A: The teacher says today’s lesson is not in the classroom.<br>老师否定了今天在教室上课。</li><li>B: The library is not mentioned as the lesson location.<br>对话没有安排去图书馆上课。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What should students do first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 大家拿到纸了吗？请先在纸上写名字，再打开书。今天的练习很短，下课前我们一起看答案。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 写名字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打开书</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看答案</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Writing a name comes before opening the book.</p><p class="cn">老师要求先写名字，再打开书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请先在纸上写名字，再打开书</p><ul><li>B: Opening the book is the second action.<br>打开书是后面的动作。</li><li>C: Checking answers happens before the lesson ends, not first.<br>一起看答案安排在下课前，不是最先。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When should the student meet the teacher?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 老师，下午两点上课，我想课前问一个问题。</p><p class="cn">female · 可以，一点四十五来办公室吧。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我一点四十五到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午一点四十五</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午两点十五</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The teacher gives one forty-five for the meeting.</p><p class="cn">老师让学生一点四十五来。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 一点四十五来办公室吧</p><ul><li>A: Two o’clock is the class start, not the meeting.<br>两点是上课时间，不是约见时间。</li><li>C: Two fifteen is not the agreed time.<br>双方没有约定两点十五。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What food does the customer finally order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我要两个面包和一杯牛奶。</p><p class="cn">female · 面包卖完了，还有包子。</p><p class="cn">male · 那我要两个包子吧，牛奶还是一杯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 包子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The final food order is two buns.</p><p class="cn">最后顾客要两个包子。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我要两个包子吧</p><ul><li>A: Bread is unavailable, so the initial order changes.<br>面包卖完了，顾客改变了原先的选择。</li><li>B: Noodles are not ordered.<br>顾客没有点面条。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. How many cups of HOT TEA are requested?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我们这桌要三杯热茶、两杯冷水。热茶给爸爸妈妈和奶奶，冷水给我和弟弟。请不要拿错了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五杯</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Three cups of hot tea are requested.</p><p class="cn">原文要求三杯热茶。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 三杯热茶、两杯冷水</p><ul><li>B: Two cups refers to cold water.<br>两杯指冷水。</li><li>C: Five counts both kinds of drinks together.<br>五杯把热茶和冷水合在一起了。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the customer choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 今天这些苹果怎么样？</p><p class="cn">female · 有点儿酸，香蕉很甜。</p><p class="cn">male · 我想买甜的。那我不要苹果了，买香蕉吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 香蕉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The customer selects the sweet bananas.</p><p class="cn">顾客选择甜的香蕉。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我不要苹果了，买香蕉吧</p><ul><li>A: The customer rejects the sour apples.<br>顾客不要有点酸的苹果。</li><li>C: Oranges are not discussed.<br>对话没有提到橙子。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much change does the customer receive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这杯豆浆多少钱？</p><p class="cn">female · 九块。</p><p class="cn">male · 给你十块。</p><p class="cn">female · 谢谢，找你一块。豆浆有点儿热，请小心。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The seller explicitly returns one yuan.</p><p class="cn">卖家直接说找一块。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 找你一块</p><ul><li>A: Nine is the price.<br>九块是豆浆的价格。</li><li>B: Ten is the amount paid.<br>十块是顾客付出的金额。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which item belongs to the older sister?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 门口有一件外套、一条围巾和一顶帽子。外套是我的，围巾是姐姐的，帽子是弟弟的。我们都找到了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 围巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外套</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The scarf belongs to the older sister.</p><p class="cn">围巾是姐姐的。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 围巾是姐姐的</p><ul><li>B: The hat belongs to the younger brother.<br>帽子是弟弟的。</li><li>C: The coat belongs to the speaker.<br>外套是说话者自己的。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When do they agree to meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 明天上午一起去买东西吧，十点见，好吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 好，我八点吃早饭，十二点要回家。十点见正好。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中午十二点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Both agree to meet at ten.</p><p class="cn">双方约定上午十点见。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 十点见正好</p><ul><li>A: Eight is the girl’s breakfast time.<br>八点是女生吃早饭的时间。</li><li>C: Noon is when she needs to return home.<br>十二点是她要回家的时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When should the girl call?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天下午什么时候能给你打电话？</p><p class="cn">male · 三点我在上课，四点到家，五点出去。你四点打给我吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The boy explicitly asks for a call at four.</p><p class="cn">男生明确让她四点打电话。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 你四点打给我吧</p><ul><li>B: He is in class at three.<br>三点他在上课。</li><li>C: He goes out at five.<br>五点他要出去。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color are the boy’s sports shoes?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我的白色运动鞋找不到了，你看见了吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 门口有一双黑色的。</p><p class="cn">male · 黑色的是爸爸的，我的白鞋在床下面。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The boy describes his own pair as white.</p><p class="cn">男生说自己的运动鞋是白色的。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我的白色运动鞋找不到了</p><ul><li>A: The black pair belongs to Dad.<br>黑色鞋是爸爸的。</li><li>B: No red shoes are described.<br>对话没有说到红鞋。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What will the boy do on Wednesday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 你这周有什么活动？</p><p class="cn">male · 星期三下午去游泳，星期五下午去公园。我喜欢游泳，也喜欢和朋友在公园走走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看电影</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Swimming is the Wednesday activity.</p><p class="cn">星期三下午去游泳。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 星期三下午去游泳</p><ul><li>A: The park visit is on Friday.<br>去公园安排在星期五。</li><li>C: No film outing is planned.<br>材料没有安排看电影。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do BEFORE playing ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 下午先去打球，好吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 我想先把这张画画完，然后去打球。</p><p class="cn">male · 好的，你画完以后叫我，我在家等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>She first wants to finish her drawing.</p><p class="cn">她想先把画画完，再去打球。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我想先把这张画画完，然后去打球</p><ul><li>B: Singing is not part of the plan.<br>计划没有唱歌。</li><li>C: Swimming is not mentioned.<br>材料没有提到游泳。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. In which month is Tian Le’s birthday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：田乐<br>学校：青禾学校<br>生日：六月十日<br>哥哥生日：十月五日<br>喜欢：看书、打篮球<br>想认识喜欢运动的朋友。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十月</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六月</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二月</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The profile gives Tian Le’s birthday as June 10.</p><p class="cn">田乐的生日是六月十日。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 生日：六月十日</p><ul><li>A: October is the older brother’s birthday month.<br>十月是哥哥生日所在月份。</li><li>C: December is not listed.<br>资料没有出现十二月。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. How many people are in Xiaoxia’s family?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小夏。我家有六个人：爷爷、奶奶、爸爸、妈妈、弟弟和我。我们住在学校旁边。弟弟明年也要上学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六个人</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The text explicitly states six people.</p><p class="cn">正文直接写家里有六个人。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我家有六个人</p><ul><li>A: Four does not match the stated size.<br>四个人与明确给出的家庭人数不符。</li><li>B: The household includes Xiaoxia as the sixth person.<br>小夏自己也在家庭六个人之中。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Where does the mother work?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我们家的工作地点<br>爸爸：饭店，做饭。<br>妈妈：学校，教英语。<br>姐姐：商店，卖衣服。<br>星期日晚上，我们常在家一起吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 学校</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 饭店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The mother teaches English at a school.</p><p class="cn">妈妈在学校教英语。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 妈妈：学校，教英语</p><ul><li>B: The father works at the restaurant.<br>饭店是爸爸的工作地点。</li><li>C: The older sister works at the shop.<br>商店是姐姐的工作地点。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who will Xiaowu take a walk with after dinner?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">阿东：<br>我今天晚上不去你家了。哥哥要工作，爸爸妈妈要去买东西。我在家和妹妹吃饭，饭后和妹妹一起散步。<br>小武</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The writer says he will walk with his younger sister.</p><p class="cn">小武说饭后和妹妹一起散步。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 饭后和妹妹一起散步</p><ul><li>A: The older brother has work; he is not the walking companion.<br>哥哥要工作，没有安排与小武散步。</li><li>B: The parents go shopping.<br>爸爸妈妈去买东西。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Where should Ma Li sit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新座位<br>小青：门旁边。<br>马力：窗户旁边。<br>田乐：老师前面的第一排。<br>下周一请大家按这个安排坐，不要拿错别人的书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 窗户旁边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 门旁边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 第一排</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The seating note puts Ma Li by the window.</p><p class="cn">座位表把马力安排在窗户旁边。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 马力：窗户旁边</p><ul><li>B: The seat near the door is Xiaoqing’s.<br>门旁边是小青的位置。</li><li>C: The first-row place is Tian Le’s.<br>第一排的位置属于田乐。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. When can students borrow books on Thursday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校图书馆通知<br>星期四上午不开门，下午两点到五点可以借书。还书也请在这个时间来。星期五上午九点正常开门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上七点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Three is within Thursday’s two-to-five opening hours.</p><p class="cn">下午三点在周四两点到五点开放时段内。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午两点到五点可以借书</p><ul><li>A: Nine in the morning refers to Friday, not Thursday.<br>上午九点开门说的是星期五。</li><li>C: Seven in the evening is outside the stated hours.<br>晚上七点不在通知给出的开放时段。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Where is the English book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同桌：<br>你的英语书在后面的书架上，中文书在桌子上，练习本在椅子上。我先去吃饭，你拿到书以后来找我。<br>小苏</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 书架上</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The English book is on the shelf at the back.</p><p class="cn">英语书在后面的书架上。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 你的英语书在后面的书架上</p><ul><li>A: The Chinese book is on the desk.<br>桌子上放的是中文书。</li><li>B: The exercise book is on the chair.<br>椅子上放的是练习本。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should Tian Ming do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放学前的工作<br>赵平：擦黑板。<br>田明：关窗户。<br>小苏：把书放到书架上。<br>请做完以后再回家。今天老师在办公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 关窗户</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 擦黑板</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把书放好</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Closing the windows is Tian Ming’s duty.</p><p class="cn">田明的任务是关窗户。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 田明：关窗户</p><ul><li>B: Cleaning the board is Zhao Ping’s duty.<br>擦黑板是赵平的任务。</li><li>C: Putting books on the shelf is Xiaosu’s duty.<br>把书放上书架是小苏的任务。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Where should students go if it rains?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">二班通知<br>明天体育课，请大家下午两点到操场，不要在教室等。带水，穿运动鞋。下雨就改在体育馆，时间不变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 体育馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Rain moves the lesson to the sports hall.</p><p class="cn">下雨就改到体育馆。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下雨就改在体育馆</p><ul><li>A: The notice tells students not to wait in the classroom.<br>通知说不要在教室等。</li><li>C: The playground is the plan before the rain change.<br>操场是不下雨时的原计划。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the break start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周五上午<br>8:00—9:00 中文课<br>9:00—10:00 英语课<br>10:00—10:30 休息<br>10:30—11:30 数学课<br>十一点半以后吃午饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The break runs from ten to ten thirty.</p><p class="cn">休息时段从十点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 10:00—10:30 休息</p><ul><li>A: Nine is when English begins.<br>九点开始英语课。</li><li>B: Ten thirty is when the break ends and mathematics begins.<br>十点半休息结束、数学课开始。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which drink is NOT sold today?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">青禾食堂早餐<br>面包：三元一个<br>包子：两元一个<br>热茶：两元一杯<br>牛奶：四元一杯<br>早上七点开始卖。今天不卖咖啡。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 咖啡</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 热茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 牛奶</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The menu explicitly says coffee is not sold today.</p><p class="cn">菜单明确写今天不卖咖啡。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天不卖咖啡</p><ul><li>B: Hot tea is listed for sale.<br>菜单列有热茶。</li><li>C: Milk is listed for sale.<br>菜单列有牛奶。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which item has TWO portions on the receipt?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午饭小票<br>米饭：两份<br>面条：一份<br>水：一瓶<br>两份米饭放在一起，面条另外装。请拿好小票，到窗口取餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The receipt lists two portions of rice.</p><p class="cn">小票写米饭两份。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 米饭：两份</p><ul><li>A: The receipt lists only one portion of noodles.<br>面条只有一份。</li><li>C: There is one bottle of water, not two portions.<br>水是一瓶，不是两份。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What does Xiaohe ask Dad NOT to add?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>今天我想吃面条，不想吃鸡蛋。请给我加一些青菜，不要加鸡蛋。弟弟想吃米饭。我们十二点到家。<br>小禾</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 青菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 鸡蛋</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Xiaohe twice says not to include eggs.</p><p class="cn">小禾明确说不要加鸡蛋。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 不要加鸡蛋</p><ul><li>A: Xiaohe asks for vegetables to be added.<br>小禾要求加一些青菜。</li><li>B: Rice is the younger brother’s meal; it is not the requested addition.<br>米饭是弟弟想吃的，不是要求加的食材。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Who wants tea without sugar?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">请按这个单子买饮料：<br>爸爸：不加糖的茶。<br>妈妈：热咖啡。<br>弟弟：苹果汁。<br>买好后放在桌上，别拿错了。谢谢！</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 弟弟</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Dad’s entry specifies tea without sugar.</p><p class="cn">爸爸一栏写不加糖的茶。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 爸爸：不加糖的茶</p><ul><li>B: Mum wants hot coffee.<br>妈妈要热咖啡。</li><li>C: The younger brother wants apple juice.<br>弟弟要苹果汁。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which T-shirt should Xiaofang collect for Aping?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：<br>我在商店买了一件大号黄色T恤，请你帮我拿回来。中号绿色那件是小田的，不要拿错。我的名字在袋子上。<br>阿平</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中号绿色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 大号黄色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小号黄色</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Aping bought the large yellow shirt.</p><p class="cn">阿平买的是大号黄色T恤。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大号黄色T恤</p><ul><li>A: The medium green shirt belongs to Xiaotian.<br>中号绿色那件是小田的。</li><li>C: The color matches but the requested size is large.<br>颜色相同，但阿平要的是大号。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does Xiaoyu need to go home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小田：<br>周日我下午四点去你家看书。五点半我要回家吃饭，不能留到六点。你觉得四点去可以吗？<br>小余</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午六点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The writer needs to return home at five thirty.</p><p class="cn">小余五点半要回家吃饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 五点半我要回家吃饭</p><ul><li>A: Four is the proposed arrival time.<br>四点是计划到朋友家的时间。</li><li>B: The writer explicitly cannot stay until six.<br>作者明确说不能留到六点。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. On which evening is the writer explicitly free to meet friends?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的晚上安排<br>周一：上画画课。<br>周二：去游泳。<br>周三：在家，有空，可以和朋友见面。<br>周四：和家人一起吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周三</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周一</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周二</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Wednesday explicitly has free time for meeting friends.</p><p class="cn">周三明确写有空，可以见朋友。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周三：在家，有空，可以和朋友见面</p><ul><li>B: Monday has a drawing class.<br>周一有画画课。</li><li>C: Tuesday is for swimming.<br>周二去游泳。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item is Xiaotian looking for?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">找衣服<br>我把一件绿色毛衣忘在公园了，上面写着“小田”。门口的白外套是小方的，不是我的。看到绿毛衣请告诉我。<br>小田</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 绿色毛衣</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝帽子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Xiaotian’s missing item is the green sweater.</p><p class="cn">小田在找遗忘的绿色毛衣。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我把一件绿色毛衣忘在公园了</p><ul><li>A: The white coat belongs to Xiaofang.<br>白外套是小方的。</li><li>C: No blue hat is described in this note.<br>便条没有提到蓝帽子。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. Where does the singing group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">唱歌小组<br>喜欢唱歌的同学，周四下午四点到二楼教室。王老师教大家唱新歌。画画小组在一楼，不要走错地方。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二楼</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The singing group is directed to the second-floor classroom.</p><p class="cn">唱歌小组去二楼教室。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周四下午四点到二楼教室</p><ul><li>A: The first floor is for the drawing group.<br>一楼是画画小组的地点。</li><li>B: The third floor is not listed for either group.<br>通知没有安排唱歌去三楼。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity do BOTH friends like?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">李平：我喜欢跳舞，不喜欢画画。<br>周月：我喜欢画画，也喜欢跳舞。<br>两人想找一个都喜欢的活动，星期天下午一起去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Both friends explicitly say they like dancing.</p><p class="cn">两人都明确说喜欢跳舞。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 李平：我喜欢跳舞，不喜欢画画。<br>周月：我喜欢画画，也喜欢跳舞。</p><ul><li>B: Only Zhou Yue likes drawing; Li Ping does not.<br>周月喜欢画画，李平不喜欢。</li><li>C: Neither friend states a preference for swimming.<br>两人都没有表示喜欢游泳。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Arrange a reading visit</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Wednesday reading visit, give a time or propose another day, and ask one question about the visit. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent personal details.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你好！星期三放学后一起去图书馆看书，好吗？你三点还是四点有空？<br>小叶</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小叶，你好！周三可以，我四点有空。我们在图书馆门口见吗？</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Wednesday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one relevant question about the visit.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">你好！周三我有课，周四四点可以吗？图书馆那时开门吗？</p><ul><li>An acceptance or a decline with an alternative can both work.</li><li>Questions about meeting place, books or opening time are relevant.</li><li>Names and invented schedules may differ; do not impose a length penalty.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a pen friend</h2><p>Read Heyue’s fictional message. Introduce Heyue in Chinese to another classmate, using third-person wording or the name. Include name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好！我叫何月，今年十四岁，在青禾学校二班上学。我们上午八点半上课。我喜欢看书，也喜欢游泳，不喜欢唱歌。希望认识新朋友！</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这位新朋友叫何月，今年十四岁。何月在青禾学校二班上学，上午八点半开始上课。何月喜欢看书，也喜欢游泳，不喜欢唱歌。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Heyue by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and class starting time.</li><li>Give at least one preference consistent with the message.</li></ul><ul><li>The task turns a first-person message into an introduction; copying it verbatim in first person gives less evidence of audience adaptation.</li><li>Do not infer gender. Using the name instead of a pronoun is acceptable.</li><li>At least one stated preference meets the preference requirement.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan an activity with a new friend</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, then allows 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task out of eight. This is fixed-prompt practice, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new friend asks about your family, interests and school day, then suggests a weekend outing.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你家有几个人？你和谁一起住？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我家有三个人。我和爸爸妈妈一起住。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">周末你喜欢做什么？不喜欢做什么？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我喜欢看书和跳舞，不喜欢打篮球。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">星期五你几点下课？下课后去哪儿？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我下午三点下课，然后去图书馆。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">星期天一起看电影，好吗？你上午还是下午有空？</p><p class="cn">Example: 好啊，我下午有空。我们两点见，好吗？</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a Thursday at school</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s Thursday in Chinese from the card. Include the student’s name, school and at least one class time, and an after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are sufficient; no minimum recording length applies.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">许乐的星期四<br>学校：青禾学校<br>上午八点半：开始上课<br>中午十二点：和同学在食堂吃饭<br>下午四点：下课<br>下课后：和朋友在操场打篮球</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这是许乐在学校的一天。许乐在青禾学校上学，上午八点半开始上课，中午和同学在食堂吃饭。下午四点下课后，许乐和朋友在操场打篮球。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Le.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity on the card.</li></ul><ul><li>The learner need not recite every card detail to meet the task.</li><li>Simple connected sentences are enough; a native-like accent or sixty seconds of speech is not required.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>无相关可评内容。</td><td>回应部分要求，遗漏关键信息。</td><td>以初阶表达回应主要要求。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>大部分意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分需借助上下文猜测。</td><td>主要意思能够理解。</td></tr><tr><td>基础语言运用</td><td>缺少可用于表达目标意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句传达部分意思，错误有时干扰。</td><td>简单词句基本适合情境，允许初阶错误。</td></tr><tr><td>组织／相关回应</td><td>缺乏可辨关系或相关回应。</td><td>有部分顺序或相关回应。</td><td>简单但连贯，回应相关、易于跟随。</td></tr></tbody></table></section></main></body></html>